sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant V as Reader
    participant N as Nodes closest to the DID
    alt the reader holds a valid local copy
        Note over V: returned at once, no network
    else
        V->>N: FIND_VALUE(key), iterative
        N-->>V: record, or closer nodes
        Note over V: first record whose key is in the tree at its position<br/>and whose signature verifies wins, no vote.<br/>A record that fails is discarded
    end
    Note over V: the application compares the public key<br/>with the key in the Verifiable Credential
